 "notes": [
  [
   "Circuit: AND!XOR's DC27 'MCP23017 16 GPIO Reference Design' rev1 (2019-03-15, Apache-2.0), read from the maker's schematic picture. Layout and artwork: SAO++.",
   [
    20.32,
    15.24
   ]
  ],
  [
   "Badge power only (recorded exception to the SAO++ power switch): J1 pin 1 feeds the chip directly, as on the maker's design. There is no coin cell on this board.",
   [
    20.32,
    20.32
   ]
  ],
  [
   "A0 = A1 = A2 = GND: 7-bit I2C address 0x20.  RESET tied to 3.3 V.  INTA, INTB, pins 11 and 14 unconnected (as the maker's).  No I2C pull-ups on the add-on.",
   [
    20.32,
    25.4
   ]
  ],
  [
   "Each output drives one red through-board LED to GND when HIGH. Resistors 1.3k (maker: 1k): about 1.1 mA per LED, about 19 mA with all 16 lit.",
   [
    20.32,
    30.48
   ]
  ]
 ]
